{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "e5fb53e466d03083b280a958f5e922280fd81503df69f47d2915d94f46373f28", "ja": "お姫さまたちのお願い", "zh": "公主们的心愿", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "239ea1a121206e0d77dc70428c4c722c226a3940b910d2f7f6eb98db26577de6", "ja": "お披露目公演をいいものにしたいと、\n張り切ってレッスンに取り組む未来達。\n限られた日数の中でもっと練習するため、\n劇場に泊まり込むことを可奈が提案。\nPrincessチームの合宿が決まった。", "zh": "未来等人为了打造精彩的首次亮相公演，\n正如火如荼地开始各种课程。\n为了能利用有限的时间进行更多练习，\n可奈提议在剧场里过夜，\n于是敲定了Princess队的集训行程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "48655507d0d8d0bad88f2a2a91cc65ea9f84c89ae80e834edddbb6834d77469f", "ja": "1、2、3、4……ここでターン！\nそして、最後の～……キメポーズ！　いぇーいっ♪", "zh": "1、2、3、4……这时要转圈！\n接着是，最后的……可爱姿势！耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "82c5bc6e273ebe836913bf5b246cf534026fb469841a5ba36a393e8cb54affea", "ja": "おおっ！？\n未来、今のバッチリ決まったんじゃない！？", "zh": "哦哦！？\n未来，刚才做得很完美耶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "095d2fa1635c26ef2f8786b71f7e65df0ccfe55a29818a69e2c8c5926273fb2f", "ja": "うんっ、息ピッタリだったよねっ？\nでへへ、気持ちいいな～っ！", "zh": "嗯，大家默契十足对吧？\n嘿嘿，感觉真棒～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "da4f9e134631edd6b9d77246d994dba1b3874769fac60ebf8d702bab5d0cd3c1", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……華麗に回る～、矢吹可奈～♪\nだけど～、目も回っちゃう～……はぅあ。", "zh": "呼、呼……华丽转圈～矢吹可奈～♪\n可是～眼睛也转圈圈～呼啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "00e96609a86cef43926852a98f006cfa1182cdfbed5f336b2448cdfb0fa26343", "ja": "わわっ、可奈ちゃん！？", "zh": "哇哇！可奈！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b70404b5a047255b3538f48e94bc26122fd93283030e5a57818e0f0858aef651", "ja": "お、おい、可奈！？　大丈夫か？", "zh": "喂、喂，可奈！？你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "98a1eef79f3b3ec45ca284648c23c90bff17007e069d60c10e5ee04730baac2b", "ja": "うぅ……エネルギー切れです～……。\nお腹がすいて、力が出ないよぉ～……。", "zh": "呜呜……人家没电了～\n肚子好饿，使不上力气呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "216e9d2becbb7580fd3cf72235c47fe8e91fa62ee4ea831dfd3458be672cb1fe", "ja": "なるほど……。よし、一旦休憩にしようか。\n俺が買い出しに行ってくるよ。", "zh": "原来是这样……好，先休息一下吧。\n我去帮大家买吃的喝的回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "16f0359ae652eb70295ae18e68f79f3ff261195833a77a4050e0a491fd021c7d", "ja": "待ってください、{$P$}さん！\n差し入れなら私、家からたくさん持ってきてますよ♪", "zh": "等一下，{$P$}先生！\n需要慰劳品的话，我从家里带了不少过来唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "1c7861a8eed9b03f7a4350b6b35833dac6d4ec5d6039e76048fd78775243550e", "ja": "えっ、ほんとですか！？　わーい！\n美奈子さん、ありがとー♪", "zh": "咦？真的吗！？耶～！\n美奈子，谢谢你～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "414163a8dd391729edd00f0b661aad2402a315dd8819f1a2731724e91d6328ef", "ja": "アタシも、レモンのはちみつ漬け持ってきたんだ～。\n疲れが取れるから、みんなで食べよっ！", "zh": "我也带了一些蜂蜜腌柠檬来喔～\n吃了可以消除疲劳，大家一起享用吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "ef1e3a6d6cd8fbd0723e4dd2ecb564443fa80b972c2dc6160681b27f78fe2e7f", "ja": "わぁ、おやつがいっぱい！\n私も今度、何かお菓子持ってこよーっと♪", "zh": "哇，有好多点心！\n我下次也带点零食过来吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d0ba14dd497b21dd695c65228b74f09811f55b0261a8bf7ab61c549648e03da2", "ja": "ふたりとも、わざわざすまないな。\nありがとう。", "zh": "这么麻烦你们两个，真是不好意思。\n谢谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "5714f6cb2d0d80fb2e6cb53e1d0d2b5c15083dc3b3135bd7b3238c1143c067bb", "ja": "あはは、気にしない、気にしない！", "zh": "啊哈哈，别在意、别在意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "5a307f94898c80a29be2e665b168830fce1814542b673de2734478baee150bf2", "ja": "{$P$}さんの分もありますから、\nたくさん食べてくださいね♪　じゃ、用意してきます！", "zh": "我也有准备{$P$}先生的份，\n要多吃一点喔♪我这就把东西拿出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "4495e9fb788d3ed456584fe1685e77a413d0fc318c82371a3f9372c4083d3a39", "ja": "ふぅ、お腹いっぱい！\n美奈子、ごちそうさまっ。おいしかった～！", "zh": "呼，肚子好撑！\n美奈子，谢谢招待，真是太好吃了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "dc62321023161d076ca6c01137dfb176c219ca4ef4b66043b7f15c990123443f", "ja": "ごちそうさま、美奈子ちゃん♪\n元気いっぱい、回復したよ～！", "zh": "谢谢招待，美奈子♪\n我又活力满满了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "ffbac4fde01d5cf1e583365d4a4ae08bcc89e5af03f38a5532f5b1f8f1c92a0e", "ja": "おかげでエネルギーまんたんです！\nレッスンもいっぱい～、できるかな～♪", "zh": "谢谢你们，我充饱电了！\n好像又能开始～满满的训练啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a4bf4dcfa9c3014110ed3141dd256fd259d357092c570b1335986f3ca0cccbfa", "ja": "ご、ごちそ……ウプッ……さま……。", "zh": "谢、谢谢招……（打嗝）……待……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "d0e94f29e05ad03801eb45b9bbda74780357395688742d31b0d4c2f56e46bde4", "ja": "はい、おそまつさまでした♪\nみんないい食べっぷりだから、うれしかったよ！", "zh": "嗯，不用客气♪\n看大家吃得这么津津有味，我好高兴喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "2ddf5fa2614b6d7513301304b1b5840161e7cb40f750f03b18516b060a010cc0", "ja": "よしっ、レッスン再開しましょー！\nカンペキにしちゃうぞ～、お～♪", "zh": "好！继续练习啰～！\n这次要练到完美～喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "77df45691fc4fb59b3b6b2b3c2e4d70972636b4a9f2910cd438ff247d96c09c4", "ja": "い、いや、ちゃんと食休みは取ろう……。\n食べてすぐに動くのは、体に毒だぞ……？", "zh": "等、等等，总要让肚子消化一下……\n刚吃饱就运动可是会伤身体的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "2196e2e436c98a990b37afa6cd680bc1ef7d580f4a6dd0604ad40f64ed43368b", "ja": "そうですね。みんな、食後はしっかり休んで、\n体中に元気をためてから再開しよう♪", "zh": "也对呢。大家，吃饱先好好休息，\n等活力充满全身以后再继续吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "2902d7fa30376000e929e2972682c1776de378dfecf451a0afb486004a65f98a", "ja": "私、休んだ後は、歌のレッスンがいいな～。\nのり子さん、どうかな？", "zh": "我休息完之后，想要练唱～\n法子，你要一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "c93500504512bc3a4cbae5d094f4f68d5b5bebe97f2a4ea83a5aee3605ac071f", "ja": "あははっ、いいんじゃないかな？\n歌いながらの方が、ダンスも覚えられるしね。", "zh": "啊哈哈，好啊。\n边唱边跳也能顺便记住舞步呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "651eabf43a9a3312044cacfeef9f34f684b7c6b92eeb261c90aaf39093b10f91", "ja": "私も歌いたいです！\nまだ、ちゃんと最後まで歌えてないですし～。", "zh": "我也想唱歌！\n我还没办法好好唱到最后呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "428e6d72a037c78ae6a77c10a193faf5a12febb870c4eae6a38b4dd755412223", "ja": "通しでやってみたいよね♪\nじゃあ休み明けは、ボーカルレッスンから！", "zh": "大家很想把整首歌完整跑一遍对吧♪\n那休息结束以后，就先练唱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "221f4edd611c825300ec610a07ee81f0e3a2fa04fe4137caf323e30950893da1", "ja": "はは、休憩中もレッスンの話か。\nすごいやる気だな、みんな。", "zh": "哈哈，连休息时都在讨论练习的事。\n大家都很有干劲呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "2dedd884ec76eb848980e4c636cd7c8e0dedd83eb7e0149b75bda1eff65185e9", "ja": "当然！　この公演はアタシたちPrincessの\nデビュー戦だもん。ベルト獲る気でいくよっ！", "zh": "那是当然！这场公演可是我们Princess的\n出道赛，要拿出勇夺冠军腰带的气势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "087253253129c6eeac93d73abaac870ca87276270849f100e9cb42f0096045c6", "ja": "うんっ。歌もダンスも、MCも……。\n覚えなきゃいけないこと、たくさんだよね！", "zh": "嗯，唱歌、跳舞还有主持……\n有好多事情需要学呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "d51c45c26e994ea6178525bfb952309d02b1e8a8444b61cd0b9ebb1f86895bfd", "ja": "ライブも料理も、下ごしらえが大切ですから。お客さん\nにご馳走を振る舞うためにも、手は抜けませんっ！", "zh": "不管是演唱会还是料理，事前准备都非常重要。\n为了让来宾看得尽兴，我们是不能偷工减料的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "e6f739189dc15ac4d3690bce4ceb33fa35acc76222399cb71707198055e65d10", "ja": "公演までまっしぐらですね！\n猪突も～しん♪　も～も～しん♪", "zh": "我们要一路向着公演前进！\n向前～冲♪冲～冲～冲♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "44a7801e320b689ca8551b424547047288c83e1d081cf8bd878abbbf5e9f9b69", "ja": "やる気があるのはいいけど、焦るのもよくないぞ。\nひとつひとつ、丁寧に仕上げていこう。", "zh": "我明白你们很有冲劲，但过于躁进也不好。\n让我们脚踏实地，一点一滴完成公演吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1034_019min", "source_sha256": "ffa8a454337a656ae79a146db6d8cef5c7448a7d17b0a20f6a92f4a1a2d1d3d1", "ja": "えへへ、そうですよね。でも、きっとみんな、\nウズウズしちゃってるんだと思います♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，说得也是。\n不过，我想大家肯定是已经兴奋难耐了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "da976d13c0445c22ebfc9dfd7e35d202a0bed74ab0d826af8a2b8ef8fdc7d7d5", "ja": "そうそう！　それに、よくわかんないですけど、\n今はレッスンするのが、すっごく楽しいんです！", "zh": "就是说啊！而且，虽然不晓得为什么，\n但我现在觉得练习课程真的好快乐喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1036_043nor", "source_sha256": "48888d385807a789dc2f9100f5c867a9eb09a4df74f1255f77f106296c2777cc", "ja": "わかる！　やっぱ、チームのみんなで一緒に頑張ってる\nせいかな～。劇場まで来る間ももったいないよね。", "zh": "我懂！应该是因为跟同分队的大家一起在努力吧～\n连移动到剧场的时间都不想浪费呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1037_036kan", "source_sha256": "41b187a50e2f424b3d51252d61ea57ea482281aa7614dd149d0e9edda2a51123", "ja": "ですよねー！　あーあ、劇場に泊まり込みとか\nできたらいいのになぁ。部活の合宿みたいに～。", "zh": "对啊～！唉～要是能在剧场过夜就好了，\n像社团的集训活动一样～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1038_019min", "source_sha256": "c3b2da6142aef3d6ae458b182745411f696e2653c301b98a016d3bf81111be1e", "ja": "合宿か～。ふふっ、みんなでお泊り、楽しそうだね！\n劇場なら十分広いし♪", "zh": "集训啊～呵呵，大家一起过夜，感觉很有趣呢！\n反正剧场的空间也很够♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1039_019min", "source_sha256": "1ddc73a9d1377281847f606fd36392d1b39fab21b3bea9bd86c59784a4e797de", "ja": "ん？　十分広いし……。\nもしかして、合宿できちゃいません？", "zh": "嗯？空间很够……\n难不成，我们真的能办集训？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "923ce41d12b04661b76eed44fe4f3bdbba9006770bcae9703c6c6cb2a644448e", "ja": "それ、すっごくいいかも！", "zh": "这个点子好像很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1041_043nor", "source_sha256": "c64123121f4c83c005081dfed48f9afcb1b6047c90d67118686e1dac019fb608", "ja": "そうだよ！\nプリンセス強化合宿、最高じゃん！", "zh": "对啊！\n公主强化集训，太赞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1042_036kan", "source_sha256": "e4a838d9355f0fef780225fc64d203af893b24a4768d7f8491bff814428c2232", "ja": "えっ？　ホントにいいんですか！？\nやった～！", "zh": "咦？真的可以吗！？\n太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1043_019min", "source_sha256": "8f6b5e0cd3ce460bb3e102da0b8e1b31b4d1629510df08218ba3f9f3fb056d59", "ja": "炊き出しは私にまかせて♪　レッスン内容に合わせて、\n必要な栄養が無理なく採れる献立を考えるから！", "zh": "煮饭就交给我吧♪我会配合练习的内容，\n想一些大家可以轻松吸收必要营养的菜单！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "c8f238e937e60f103a11484d50248cf90dede6e87ad7f6c15e288ed60583627d", "ja": "お、おい、ちょっと待ってくれ！\n劇場に泊まるって、さすがにそれは難しいぞ？", "zh": "喂、喂，你们先等一下！\n再怎么说都没法在剧场过夜吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "cda650d08caa29ef863454af8e6a6c094bc67be3f053efc48ee376ac1215e5ec", "ja": "え～。でも、{$P$}さんも、\nたまに泊まってるじゃないですか～？", "zh": "咦～可是，{$P$}先生\n不也偶尔会在剧场过夜吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1046_p", "source_sha256": "79cf68ed48c44def2df65bd295593546153ecd122c459f23d49f359ca9896e8e", "ja": "うっ。まあ俺は、忙しいときには、\nしょうがなく泊まることもあるが……。", "zh": "唔！我在忙的时候，\n确实是会逼不得已在这边过夜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1047_043nor", "source_sha256": "b19f4859bd3877538b4823bae576b39ad3876494f2df98865e4d0754eed421ff", "ja": "{$P$}がいいなら、\nアタシたちもいけるでしょ！", "zh": "{$P$}可以的话，\n那我们当然也行吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1048_p", "source_sha256": "8c9126bc313734b22019d73aaa39cb725e0a25ea65ceb45e3f31e6ab0fca1916", "ja": "いやいや！　俺ひとりとPrincess全員とじゃ\n話が違うだろ？　まず社長の許可も必要だし……", "zh": "不不不！我一个人和Princess全员\n不能相提并论吧？还需要先取得社长的许可……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1049_036kan", "source_sha256": "5a7bcb86594cb730cea30d0ed23f373a8f530910bba0aa10f44babdbd7e91de9", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんなら、\n社長を説得できちゃいますよねっ？", "zh": "可是，{$P$}先生\n肯定有办法说服社长吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1050_019min", "source_sha256": "6044da850a4ff1171112950baaf71ca12064f36dac9b86cf2dd490167a6b9a71", "ja": "小さい子たちのお世話も、ちゃんとしますから！\nお願いします、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我也会负责照顾年纪比较小的人！\n拜托你了，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1051_p", "source_sha256": "bc826b48ec3243dfc074b8f44e5c51e799a22e8b7a58a0991a0db112787dbd17", "ja": "いやでも、話が急すぎるしな……。みんなの親御さんも\n心配するだろうし、無責任なことはできないよ。", "zh": "再怎么说，这都太突然了……你们的家长\n肯定也会担心，我不能做这么不负责任的承诺。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1052_014mir", "source_sha256": "f92480c18060fcda8c10f9416765d2d2f2409f4898c6aee2e9dda9f982ac5a23", "ja": "うちは平気だと思うけどなぁ……。\nみんな～、ちょっと相談、相談しよう！", "zh": "我家应该是不用担心啦……\n大家～我们来讨论讨论一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1057_p", "source_sha256": "079f2f3c889dd875e1ed7bc71876661177f98fd997e7bfd06b91632015fe23db", "ja": "お、おい、どうした？　内緒話なんかして……！", "zh": "喂、喂，这是在做什么？居然不让我听……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1058_014mir", "source_sha256": "4e26d06a2579a1774b03eba63e36014067adb729dc8da5841db3ee4b7b195901", "ja": "わかりましたっ！　私達、合宿あきらめま～す！", "zh": "好吧！我们决定放弃集训～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1059_p", "source_sha256": "01e5820bb4a129c07162033f51df1781c3ed12552bab0993dc731a9d5e4e76a0", "ja": "まて、なんだそのワクワクした顔は！？\nさては、内緒で合宿する気だろう！", "zh": "等等，你那兴奋的表情是怎么回事！？\n你们要瞒着我偷偷来对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1060_014mir", "source_sha256": "50b0438a0bb251155e9c057884104f4915cc2e48dd0dbb743f2aaacd9b900de4", "ja": "えっ！　それはその……。\nソンナコトナイデスヨ？", "zh": "咦！这个、那个……\n没、有、这、回、事、喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1061_p", "source_sha256": "35a25692d1895b3ecfd3596ed463e9c3405ba3000a9ab8350809d437bea74918", "ja": "（する気だ……！）", "zh": "（摆明就想……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_1062", "source_sha256": "c6bc7aee10858111c7ff94c66c39c2918846a6b47640d8bac6d0df59b2b791e6", "ja": "なんとかする", "zh": "想办法解决", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_2000_p", "source_sha256": "2c9766cde8844088d1414079b9a6b0f171006ba01d35b42e03f041bdbb749bfd", "ja": "はぁ……わかったよ。Princess合宿、\nちゃんと手配するから、勝手なことはしないようにな！", "zh": "唉……我知道了啦。Princess的集训，\n我会妥善安排的，你们可别私底下乱来喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_2001_014mir", "source_sha256": "770da2054e3cf81b6905efc8d787015ad8f249d896aa2780f3e3753f6c17843a", "ja": "やった～っ！", "zh": "太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_2002_036kan", "source_sha256": "770da2054e3cf81b6905efc8d787015ad8f249d896aa2780f3e3753f6c17843a", "ja": "やった～っ！", "zh": "太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_2003_019min", "source_sha256": "8237b8a46a28082d0c545374104bf90699e6966e544708df37fa3389dc28a068", "ja": "わっほ～い！", "zh": "哇哦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_2004_043nor", "source_sha256": "f4258ef246bbe23d6b16ccf75dc5ce25c200ad0708322b113bfa678081273ab2", "ja": "やったねっ！", "zh": "成功了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_2005_014mir", "source_sha256": "af49e818b7c8f47c7c257b3ce6e07736aaab729642f9604dbd7261dccd21c31b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、大好き～っ！\nみんなでお泊り、楽しみだなぁ～♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，最爱你了～！\n好期待跟大家一起过夜呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_2006_036kan", "source_sha256": "d497ea2b727967b7a69ec5426e45ef20210b34866d9b5c390122eafb7b0a67a4", "ja": "合宿～、合宿～♪\n可奈のテンションはマックス～♪", "zh": "集训～集训～♪\n可奈现在嗨到极点～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_2007_019min", "source_sha256": "dd799717de6242c21228ba375891808a4ef1bdb667bb7e19c5ae7dcd1b7ac945", "ja": "早速、Princessのみんなにメールしますね！", "zh": "我马上传简讯给Princess的大家喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_2008_043nor", "source_sha256": "1baf129a6cccde88fc05d8f014611b45e968bbe2aa14e76564ba3e03d0cb384c", "ja": "わがまま言っちゃってゴメンね？\nでも、ありがと、{$P$}♪", "zh": "对不起我们这么任性，\n不过，谢谢你，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_2009_p", "source_sha256": "fe59b1011667c5f555a84ed44e9e413cc6566aede5508df8bc3ac747b53d7577", "ja": "（悪気のないワガママには、困ったもんだ。\nでも、これがPrincessらしさなのかもしれない）", "zh": "（面对这么纯真的任性要求，还真不晓得怎么拒绝。\n不过，这或许就是Princess的特色吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_02_2010_p", "source_sha256": "1aa282dab972c21c34ed2a4dc09e1e85427ca77acce6e23101ae3958b625368e", "ja": "（お姫さま達を乗せた馬車は、描いた夢に向かって\nまっすぐ進んでいく。御者役、しっかり務めよう！）", "zh": "（公主们搭乘的马车，正朝着梦想笔直前进。\n我身为车夫，可得帮她们拉好缰绳才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
